 "text": "Harrison Township Assessor / Vigo County, Indiana\nSkip over navigation\nVigo County, Indiana\nSearch\nSubmit\n-->\nMenu\nCounty Offices \nCommissioners  Meeting Center\nARPA\nCouncil\nArea Planning  Apply for a Permit\nRezoning\nSubdivisions\nBoard of Zoning Appeals\nPlan Commission\nFloodplain Information\nAgendas and Minutes\nAssessor\nAuditor\nBuilding Inspections\nClerk  Elections\nMarriage\nConvention and Visitors\nCoroner\nExtension Service\nHarrison Township Assessor\nHealth Department  Environmental Health\nHealth Clinic\nHealth Education\nVector\nVital Statistics\nHighway Department\nHuman Resources  Employee Benefits\nEmployment/Jobs\nNews and Announcements\nPolicies\nInformation Technology\nPark Department\nRecorder\nRedevelopment  Industrial Park\nSoil and Water  NRCS\nSolid Waste Management\nSurveyor  Access Cover Project\nBruce W. Allen Jr.\nOriginal Government Surveys\nRegulated Legal Drains\nReport Damaged Section Corners\nState Line Marker\nStone Perpetuation Program\nUser Disclaimer\nStone Database\nTreasurer\nVeteran's Assistance\nVoter Registration\nWeights & Measures\nCourthouse \nCASA\nClerk  Child Support\nCivil Filings\nCourt Records\nCourts  Indiana Legal Help\nDrug Court\nIV-D Court\nJury Administration\nJuvenile Division\nProbate Division\nSuperior Court 1\nSuperior Court 2\nSuperior Court 3\nSuperior Court 4\nSuperior Court 5\nSuperior Court 6\nVeterans Court\nHomes for Children\nJuvenile Center\nProsecutor  Adult Protective Services\nAlcohol/Drug Prosecution\nCheck Deception\nChild Support\nChild Support Division\nCrime Victim Assistance Program\nCriminal\nCriminal Division\nDomestic Violence\nInfraction Deferrals\nHigh Tech Crime Unit\nPublic Defender\nTaxes\nPublic Safety \nCourt Services  Adult Probation\nCommunity Corrections\nJuvenile Probation\nPre-Trial Services\nDrug Task Force\nEmergency Management\nEnhanced 911\nFire Investigation\nPrevention\nSheriff\nHow Do I? \nBrowse the County Staff\nConnect with Vigo County on Social Media\nContact a Township Trustee\nFind an Event\nFind a Location\nFind a Service\nReport a Pothole or other Road Hazard\nSubmit a Request\nView County Ordinances\nView FAQs\nView a Slideshow\nVisit the Meeting Center\nFind a Document  Agendas\nForms & Applications\nJob Postings\nMinutes\nNews & Notices\nRelated Pages\nStart Content\nSearch\nSubmit\nHome\nGovernment\nHarrison Township Assessor\nHarrison Township Assessor\nAbout Us\nWhat We Do\nThe assessor's office is responsible for accurately and uniformly determining the market-value-in-use of all property using one of the three approaches to value: Cost, Income, and Sales Comparison. The most commonly used approach to value is the Cost Approach, which is determined using cost schedules provided and determined by the State of Indiana. We are also responsible for various duties that include examining and collecting information on the physical characteristics of property, review and verify changes made through permit filings, and review documents used in the transfer of property. Detailed information on what we do can be found in the \"Topics of Interest\" section to the right of this page.\nGIS MAP\nNews\nRecent News\nSales Disclosure Form\nContact Us\nChristina Patterson ,\nHarrison Township Assessor\n167 Oak St\nTerre Haute, IN 47807 Get Directions\nPhone: (812) 462-3271\nEmail Us\nStaff Directory\nHours: Monday-Friday\n8AM-4PM\nTopics of Interest\nCommercial & Industrial Properties\nCyclical Reassessment\nPersonal Property\nProperty Sales\nRental Properties\nJump to a topic or subtopic Make a Selection Commercial & Industrial Properties Cyclical Reassessment Personal Property Property Sales Rental Properties Topic Home\nMore Information\nFind content and services related to this page.\nDocument Center FAQs\nForms & Applications\nNews & Notices\nPublic Documents\nLocations\nJump to a content archive Make a Selection Locations Document Center\n- Forms & Applications\n- FAQs\n- Public Documents\n- News & Notices\n© 2026 Vigo County, Indiana\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility Statement\nTerms of Use\nLegal Center\nSite Design and Content Management by\nCore Business Technologies\nPhotography by: Brendan Kearns",
